  "details": "I applied the greyscale color filter for the screenshots attached below but it's any settings are not applied. Here is a list of all the areas that do not apply the filter\n\n1. VRC Shop icons\n\n2. Avatar Preview\n\n3. Camera (but probably intentional but would be nice to have the filters apply as an option)\n\n4. Stickers\n\n5. Props/Items\n\n6. Effects\n\n7. Drones and portals (cosmetic items)\n\n8. some icons in live now\n\n9. profile icons",
